    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Excellent opportunity to purchase an Individual site to the rear of 13 Windsor Avenue.\r\n\r\nDescription of Proposed Development Planning permission for the provision of a 61sqm, 1-bed with attic room, 2 & ½ -storey mews dwelling, with single-storey element against rear boundary. Slate pitched roof to main mews and standing seam zinc roof to rear single-storey element and white brick external finish facing laneway, with undercroft car and bicycle parking.\r\n\r\nSituated in this highly regarded and much sought after location on the doorstep of the City Centre and adjacent to all local services and amenities, this is definitely one for the short list. There is a wide variety of schools, businesses and local transport facilities on the doorstep, which include, Clontarf DART station, the LUAS, St Josephs School, and Fairview park. O'Connell Street is within a 20 minute walk away.\r\n\r\nApplication Reference - WEB5901/25\r\n\r\nWell serviced by local transport links\r\nSchools, shops and businesses on the doorstep\r\nQuiet cul-de-sac\r\nConvenient to Dublin City Centre"
      }
    ],
